cli/curator.md:111:# Syntax and schema validation may run without source coverage.
cli/curator.md:114:# A dry run may fetch into removable private state and audit exact source, but
cli/curator.md:115:# creates no persistent repository, snapshot, receipt, cache, marker, or shim.
cli/curator.md:118:# A real install must resolve and independently audit every external source
cli/curator.md:119:# before artifact-cache lookup or compilation.
cli/curator.md:122:# Status is read-only and never contacts a remote just to re-test a tag.
cli/curator.md:125:# Repair repeats exact acquisition, audit, and transaction publication.
cli/curator.md:128:# GC retains every marker/journal root and uncertain protected entry.
